A '''Water Hydra''' is a {{Legendary}} [[Sea Creature]] that can be fished up after unlocking it at {{skl|Fishing|19}}.

== Spawning ==
A '''Water Hydra''' can be caught on the [[Hub Island]] and most other non-fishing islands. It requires {{Skill|Fishing|19}} or higher to be fished up.

The base [[Sea Creatures#Sea Creature Weight|Weight]] for the '''Water Hydra''' is {{Green|18}}, resulting in a default catch chance of {{Chance|0.42%|1|238.67|sea creatures}} with all Sea Creatures unlocked. Certain modifiers can be used to increase it:
