== Behavior ==
The '''Water Hydra''' moves incredibly fast towards the player and attempt to hit them. Once it reaches {{stat|hp|50%}}, another '''Water Hydra''' spawns with {{Green|50%}} of its original {{stat|hp}}. Both '''Water Hydras''' can drop items.

