== Trivia ==
*Since '''Water Hydras''' count as zombies, their Combat XP is enough to spawn a {{Stier|5}} {{MobSprite|Revenant Horror}} given that another Water Hydra spawns below 50% of their {{Stat|short=yes|health}}.
*The name and ability of the '''Water Hydra''' are based on the Hydra in Greek mythology, which grows two additional heads each time one is severed.

